# StateSync-GKR line-ending policy.
# Keep source, proofs, and documentation on LF across supported development
# environments so line-ending conversion cannot create phantom changes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.rs   text eol=lf
*.thy  text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
# Binary artifacts are excluded from text normalization.
*.pdf  binary
